 // are (0050b380, 0050b395). The report's constructor already zeroes mUnknown00, so it is not stored again here.
+// Port (patch 0023): VC6 ranks the three squares of every magnitude here as (Z*Z + Y*Y) + X*X (0050b0fa..0050b111,
+// 0050b2c7..0050b2db, 0050b455..0050b46b); clang keeps Magnitude's (X*X + Y*Y) + Z*Z.
